The route-age gap between the two paths reflects the different convergence speeds: EIGRP/direct-redistribution via R11 (1 hop to R1) versus multi-area OSPF via R7→R6→R4(ABR)→R3→R1 (4 hops, two area boundaries, Type-3 LSA generation). This is entirely consistent with normal initial OSPF convergence in a complex multi-area lab. The user's ticket was almost certainly filed during the first few minutes of lab convergence, before R7's inter-area routes reached R1.

